# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VideoAscend — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env for local overrides.
# The app works with zero environment variables set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# AI Advisor (optional)
# Only needed if you want to pre-seed the API key during development.
# In normal use, the user enters their key inside the app and it is
# stored encrypted in electron-store — this env var is not required.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# GitHub token (optional)
# Only needed for GitHub Actions automated release publishing.
# Set as a repository secret in GitHub, not in this file.
# GH_TOKEN=ghp_...
